{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2023-05-18 12:00:00', 'title': 'SWK INVESTORS HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, INC. SECURITIES FRAUD LAWSUIT', 'text': 'LOS ANGELES , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE LAW OFFICES OF FRANK R. CRUZ ANNOUNCES THAT INVESTORS WITH SUBSTANTIAL LOSSES HAVE OPPORTUNITY TO LEAD THE SECURITIES FRAUD CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AGAINST STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, INC. ("STANLEY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: SWK).'}{'symbol': 'SWK', 'date': '2023-05-18 05:45:00', 'title': 'SWK LAWSUIT ALERT: LEVI & KORSINSKY NOTIFIES STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, INC. INVESTORS OF A CLASS ACTION LAWSUIT AND UPCOMING DEADLINE', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 18, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0LEVI & KORSINSKY, LLP NOTIFIES INVESTORS IN STANLEY BLACK & DECKER, INC. ("STANLEY" OR THE "COMPANY") (NYSE: SWK) OF A CLASS ACTION SECURITIES LAWSUIT. CLASS DEFINITION: THE LAWSUIT SEEKS TO RECOVER LOSSES ON BEHALF OF STANLEY INVESTORS WHO WERE ADVERSELY AFFECTED BY ALLEGED SECURITIES FRAUD BETWEEN OCTOBER 28, 2021 AND JULY 28, 2022.'}